sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as parent (-fork=N)<br/>runs no target code
    participant C as child job n
    participant M as merge control file
    participant D as corpus dir
    P->>P: CreateNewJob: strip -fork/-runs, add -reload=0,<br/>max_total_time = min(300, n)
    P->>C: spawn with sqrt(N) seeds, private corpus + features dir
    C->>C: the whole Chapter 1 loop, in its own process
    alt the child finds a bug
        C-->>P: exit 77 (crash) / 70 (timeout) / 71 (OOM)
        P->>P: classify: IgnoreCrashes? IgnoreOOMs? IgnoreTimeouts?
    else the child times out cleanly
        C-->>P: exit 0
    end
    P->>M: CrashResistantMerge over the child's new files
    M-->>P: which files carry features the main corpus lacks
    P->>D: copy just those into the shared corpus
    P->>C: spawn job n+1 with a fresh subset
    Note over P,D: a crash kills a child, never the campaign
